  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 406.02 Public Water System Capacity Assurance. All proposed NTNC water systems shall comply with the requirements of Env-Dw 602 before the operation of such water system begins.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 406) #10613, eff 6-1-14; ss by #14158, eff 12-25-24 (formerly Env-Dw 406.03)",
